The new code accesses `user.Preferences.Theme` without checking if `Preferences` is nil. Old users have NULL in the preferences column.

```go
func GetProfile(user *User) ProfileResponse {
    return ProfileResponse{
        Name:  user.Name,
        Theme: user.Preferences.Theme, // crashes when Preferences is nil
    }
}
```

What is the root cause and what needs to change?

The root cause is an unbounded in-memory cache with no eviction. The code:

```go
var sessionCache = map[string]*SessionData{}

func GetSession(id string) *SessionData {
    if data, ok := sessionCache[id]; ok {
        return data
    }
    data := loadFromDB(id)
    sessionCache[id] = data
    return data
}
```

Entries are added but never removed. What would you change?
